=Date: {{ $now.toFormat("cccc d LLLL yyyy") }}

INBOX TRIAGE from the Email Triage Agent:
{{ JSON.stringify($("Email Triage Agent").item.json.output ?? {}) }}

DAY PLAN from the Day Planner Agent:
{{ JSON.stringify($("Day Planner Agent").item.json.output ?? {}) }}

Write the briefing narrative that ties the two together.

parameters.html:
=<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Daily briefing</title>
<style>
:root { color-scheme: light; }
body { margin: 0; background: #eef1f6; color: #1b2330; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.55; }
.wrap { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px 20px 56px; }
.card { background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dfe4ec; border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px 24px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
.hero { background: #12203a; border-color: #12203a; color: #ffffff; }
.eyebrow { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1.6px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8fa6c9; }
.hero h1 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 650; }
.hero p.sub { margin: 0; color: #c2d0e6; font-size: 14px; }
.hero p.date { margin: 14px 0 0; color: #8fa6c9; font-size: 13px; }
.tag { display: inline-block; margin-top: 14px; padding: 4px 11px; border-radius: 999px; background: #1f3559; color: #cfe0ff; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.6px; text-transform: uppercase; }
.stats { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
.stat { flex: 1 1 130px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dfe4ec; border-radius: 14px; padding: 14px 16px; }
.stat b { display: block; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 650; color: #12203a; }
.stat span { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1.1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #75839a; }
h2 { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #75839a; font-weight: 650; }
ol, ul { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
li { padding: 12px 0; border-top: 1px solid #eceff5; }
li:first-child { padding-top: 0; border-top: 0; }
li b { display: block; font-size: 15px; color: #12203a; font-weight: 600; }
li i { font-style: normal; color: #5c6a80; font-size: 13px; }
li em { font-style: normal; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 3px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: 0.4px; color: #1d4ed8; }
.reply li em { color: #b42318; }
.warn { background: #fff8f1; border-color: #f3d7b8; }
.warn h2 { color: #a15c07; }
.warn li { border-top-color: #f3e3cf; color: #7c4a07; font-size: 14px; }
.free li { border-top-color: #dff0e2; color: #216e39; font-size: 14px; }
.free { background: #f3fbf4; border-color: #cde9d3; }
.free h2 { color: #216e39; }
.muted { color: #75839a; font-size: 14px; margin: 0; }
.summary { font-size: 15px; color: #33415a; margin: 0; }
footer { text-align: center; color: #8b97ab; font-size: 12px; padding-top: 8px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

<div class="card hero">
<p class="eyebrow">Daily briefing</p>
<h1>{{ $json.output?.headline || "Your day at a glance" }}</h1>
<p class="sub">{{ $json.output?.summary || "" }}</p>
<p class="date">{{ $now.toFormat("cccc d LLLL yyyy") }}</p>
<span class="tag">{{ $json.output?.mood || "steady" }}</span>
</div>

<div class="stats">
<div class="stat"><b>{{ $("Day Planner Agent").item.json.output?.meetingCount ?? 0 }}</b><span>Meetings</span></div>
<div class="stat"><b>{{ Math.round(($("Day Planner Agent").item.json.output?.bookedMinutes ?? 0) / 6) / 10 }}h</b><span>Booked</span></div>
<div class="stat"><b>{{ ($("Email Triage Agent").item.json.output?.needsReply ?? []).length }}</b><span>Need reply</span></div>
<div class="stat"><b>{{ $("Email Triage Agent").item.json.output?.totalCount ?? 0 }}</b><span>New email</span></div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Top priorities</h2>
<ol>{{ ($json.output?.topPriorities ?? []).length ? ($json.output.topPriorities).map(p => "<li><em>" + (p.when || "Today") + "</em><b>" + p.what + "</b><i>" + (p.why || "") + "</i></li>").join("") : "<li><i>Nothing is competing for your attention today.</i></li>" }}</ol>
</div>

<div class="card reply">
<h2>Inbox &middot; needs your reply</h2>
<ul>{{ (($("Email Triage Agent").item.json.output?.needsReply) ?? []).length ? ($("Email Triage Agent").item.json.output.needsReply).map(e => "<li><em>" + (e.dueBy || "No deadline") + "</em><b>" + e.subject + "</b><i>" + e.from + (e.why ? " &middot; " + e.why : "") + "</i></li>").join("") : "<li><i>Nobody is waiting on you.</i></li>" }}</ul>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Inbox &middot; worth knowing</h2>
<ul>{{ (($("Email Triage Agent").item.json.output?.important) ?? []).length ? ($("Email Triage Agent").item.json.output.important).map(e => "<li><b>" + e.subject + "</b><i>" + e.from + (e.why ? " &middot; " + e.why : "") + "</i></li>").join("") : "<li><i>Nothing important beyond the replies above.</i></li>" }}</ul>
<p class="muted">Plus {{ (($("Email Triage Agent").item.json.output?.fyi) ?? []).length }} FYI and {{ $("Email Triage Agent").item.json.output?.noiseCount ?? 0 }} low value messages filtered out.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Today on the calendar</h2>
<ul>{{ (($("Day Planner Agent").item.json.output?.timeline) ?? []).length ? ($("Day Planner Agent").item.json.output.timeline).map(v => "<li><em>" + v.time + (v.endTime ? " to " + v.endTime : "") + "</em><b>" + v.title + "</b><i>" + [v.withWho, v.location].filter(Boolean).join(" &middot; ") + (v.prep ? "<br>Prep: " + v.prep : "") + "</i></li>").join("") : "<li><i>No meetings today.</i></li>" }}</ul>
</div>

<div class="card free">
<h2>Focus windows</h2>
<ul>{{ (($("Day Planner Agent").item.json.output?.focusWindows) ?? []).length ? ($("Day Planner Agent").item.json.output.focusWindows).map(w => "<li>" + w + "</li>").join("") : "<li>No protected block longer than 45 minutes today.</li>" }}</ul>
</div>

<div class="card warn">
<h2>Watch out</h2>
<ul>{{ [...($json.output?.watchOuts ?? []), ...($("Day Planner Agent").item.json.output?.conflicts ?? [])].length ? [...($json.output?.watchOuts ?? []), ...($("Day Planner Agent").item.json.output?.conflicts ?? [])].map(w => "<li>" + w + "</li>").join("") : "<li>No conflicts detected.</li>" }}</ul>
</div>

<footer>Assembled by the Email Triage, Day Planner and Chief Of Staff agents at {{ $now.toFormat("HH:mm") }}.</footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
